    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="38">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 38</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Nis on ænigne timan unriht alyfad, ⁊ ðeah man sceal freolstídan ⁊ on freolsstowan geornlicost bebyrgan.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Lawlessness is not permitted at any time, yet at sacred seasons and in sacred places special care must be taken to prevent it.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Nis on ænigne timan unriht alyfed; ⁊ þeah man sceal freolstidan ⁊ fæstentidan ⁊ on freolsstowan geornlicost beorgan.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
